PRE 4.2.0 (P3): hosted netdev shutdown + shell atexit; netdev authz; ARP tick and gratuitous ARP; fl_net_route_configure_static; bare-metal lab netdev (802.3-style RX ring, ICMP/ARP on wire) with PIT-driven fl_net_baremetal_timer_poll. Full loopback paths retained in net_wire_egress/host. Closes #232, #233, #235; partial #237/#240/#241 (no virtio NIC). P3-7 RFC 793 FSM open (#238).
